flowchart TB
  subgraph ExistingAircraft[Existing aircraft and flight crew - OUTSIDE AI]
    A[Aircraft systems and health events]
    P[Flight crew and established flight procedures]
  end
  A --> G[Existing aircraft communications / ground health platform]
  G --> MCC[Maintenance Control: ground preparation authorization]
  subgraph GroundPrivate[Airline-controlled ground environment]
    I[Validated event adapter + policy gate]
    W[Bounded recovery workflow]
    M[Local SLM: searches and cited briefing]
    R[Current authorized document retrieval]
    T[Read adapters: history / parts / staff / tools / rotations]
    C[Deterministic constraints and timing]
    AP[Versioned preparation approval gateway]
    D[(Case, evidence and audit store)]
    O[Simulated outbox and reversible hold]
    I --> W
    W <--> M
    W --> R
    W --> T
    W --> C
    W --> D
    AP --> O
    AP --> D
  end
  MCC --> I
  W --> H[Human review - APPROVE PREPARATION]
  H --> AP
  E[External maintenance completion AFTER arrival] --> D
